<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs off $0.500 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs off $0.500 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower than Tuesday's close. Top $57.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    55.50-57.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-2.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    39.00-43.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    48.00-52.00</p>
</text>
